			description: [
				"&f&lSide Quest · Stash & Sort.&r"
				""
				"The sieve is about to bury you: chunks, seeds, gems, dust, pebbles - sixteen kinds of everything, forever. Double chests are where items go to disappear."
				""
				"This chapter is the cure, in three schools: &edrawer walls&r you can read at a glance, &esmart containers&r that sort themselves, and &eone terminal&r that searches every chest you own. Start with this free backpack."
			]
