		{
			dependencies: ["57D0000000000001"]
			description: [
				"A &eSophisticated Barrel&r is a chest that grew up: bigger, upgradeable, and with a &lsort button&r. Wood tiers upgrade in place - no repacking."
				""
				"For everything that isn't bulk-stackable, these replace vanilla chests outright."
			]
