			title: "&fSophisticated Barrels"
			x: -6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["57D0000000000005"]
			description: [
				"A &eStack Upgrade&r multiplies how much every slot holds. Slot one into a barrel and watch a single container swallow a whole farm's output."
				""
				"&e&lThey multiply, they do not add.&r Each tier stacks on the last, so a barrel with several upgrades holds absurd quantities per slot rather than merely a few more. This is the cheapest capacity in the pack by a wide margin - far cheaper than more AE2 cells."
				""
				"&e&lSophisticated Storage upgrades worth knowing:&r"
				"&7- &fStack&7 - raw capacity, the one you want first"
				"&7- &fPickup&7 - vacuums matching items straight off the ground into the barrel"
				"&7- &fMagnet&7 - wider-range pickup"
				"&7- &fCompacting&7 - auto-compresses to blocks as it fills"
				"&7- &fFiltered / Advanced Filtered&7 - only accepts what you specify"
				"&7- &fVoid&7 - throws away overflow once full. Dangerous, but the correct answer for cobblestone."
				""
				"&7Barrels and backpacks take the same upgrades, so anything you learn here carries into your Hungry Backpack.&r"
				""
				"&8Start this chapter early. Sorting is not a late-game luxury in a pack where the sieve never stops producing."
			]
			icon: "sophisticatedstorage:stack_upgrade_tier_1"
			id: "57D0000000000006"
			rewards: [{
