			description: [
				"Everything so far has needed a physical connection. These don't."
				""
				"An &eEnder Chest&r is a container addressed by a three-dye colour code. Two chests set to the same code are the same chest, whether they're one block apart or in different dimensions. The &eEnder Tank&r does the same for fluids."
				""
				"On a skyblock this is how you get resources from a mining dimension or a nether outpost back to base without building anything between them."
